# The 1939 scenario as the Axis side, written by hand: Paratroop with no army that can go. The Axis
# side has no Elite army in 1939, so the game says "NO ELIGIBLE UNITS TO PARATROOP" and shows
# COMMANDS again. This once stopped the game with "Subscript out of range" (docs/devnotes.md,
# item 16). The message shows during a timed pause, which a script skips, so no digest sees it.
# Then Esc, and Files, Quit, Yes.
#! seed 1939
#! cfg side=2

rule 1 key space

# The title menu: Start NEW Game. Start Year: 1939.
play until 2:W
text s
play until 2:S
key enter

# COMMANDS, Paratroop, and COMMANDS again.
play until 2:M
text c
play until 2:C
digest
text p
play until 2:C
digest
key esc

# Files, Quit, then Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
digest
text y
repeat space
